	(75, 1, '2023-10-12 03:34:08', '2023-10-12 01:34:08', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Aliquam justo felis, commodo id arcu sit amet, vehicula semper nisl. Mauris cursus, ipsum nec vulputate pulvinar, ex turpis commodo lorem, sit amet facilisis mi nunc varius magna. Pellentesque ac enim nec sem pulvinar aliquam. Etiam feugiat dui lacus, a tempus leo mattis non. Aenean in ornare sapien. Nam eleifend interdum diam, vitae gravida nibh sodales vitae. Donec mollis arcu vitae egestas mattis. Proin aliquet laoreet metus, commodo viverra tellus eleifend vitae. Nulla pharetra at augue ac aliquam. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Adresse courriel : retrolounge2049@gmail.com</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":74} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image"><img src="http://localhost/wpprojet/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/pacman.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-74"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->', 'Contactez-moi', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '25-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-10-12 03:34:08', '2023-10-12 01:34:08', '', 25, 'http://localhost/wpprojet/2023/10/12/25-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
